		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<p>We provide a construction of chosen ciphertext secure publickey encryption from (injective) trapdoor functions. Our construction is black box and assumes no special properties (e.g. &quot;lossy&quot;, &quot;correlated product secure&quot;) of the trapdoor function.</p>
